# Graphify knowledge-graph output (regenerate with `/graphify .`).
# Large generated artifacts + a full mirror of the source — never commit.
graphify-out/
.graphify/
*.graphml
cypher.txt
GRAPH_REPORT.md
raw/

# AI assistant local state
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.codebuddy/
CLAUDE.local.md

# Secrets — belt and braces. Never commit real credentials; only *.example.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/google-credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
secrets.json

